; Labels and system variables of the Amstrad CPC 464 firmware.
; Generated by tools/make-cpc-symbols.py: the names are those of the 6128 source
; (github.com/Bread80/CPC6128-Firmware-Source, from the original commented
; disassembly of the 6128 firmware by Kevin Thacker), carried over to this ROM by
; matching the code. Names ending in _ROM are routines of the lower ROM.
; Same format as the symbol files exported by SjASM/SjASMPlus.
; Lower ROM (the first &40 bytes are in RAM too)
